  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> be real valued function defined as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now differentiating the above function we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now by wavy curve method we get,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0081_fb2a9cbb4bc8.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 106px;\" /></p><p>So Graph of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;for given domain will be,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0081_e840a5851efd.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 250px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So, from graph range is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo></math></p>"
